% tokens (closed-world sort checking)
junk: type.
src: type.
out: type.
pulse: type.
done: type.

% Multiplicative unit in rule bodies (Phase 6): `I` decomposes to NOTHING —
% an affine discard `A -o { I }` must not leak a literal unit fact.

kill: junk -o { I }.
tick: src -o { out * I }.
noop: I * pulse -o { done }.
